          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_005]] [[EV_006]] [[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Okay, noted. My business calendar has been quite full, so I have been setting aside quiet time for personal administration rather than trying to handle it between meetings."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "That sounds like a busy schedule. For account correspondence, I can keep the administrative updates brief and separate from unrelated messages."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Thank you. That would make them easier to review. [[EV_017]] [[EV_020]] [[EV_022]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Please allow me a moment to finish my notes. There is no need to stay on the line for general housekeeping afterwards."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "That's helpful. I prefer to deal with personal paperwork myself, away from the logistics team's daily correspondence."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_018]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_019]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I apologise for the note-taking error. [[EV_010]]"
